NOTICE
======

This package (soarm101_description) contains modified versions of source code 
and 3D models originally provided by The Robot Studio (first released in 2024).

Original source repository:
https://github.com/TheRobotStudio/SO-ARM100 
(Original file: Simulation/SO101/so101_new_calib.urdf and associated STL meshes)

Modifications made by Alice Zenina and Alexander Grachev, RTU MIREA (2026):
- Adaptation for the ROS 2 stack (added 'world' link and 'world_to_base_joint').
- Migration to Xacro format for flexible parameterization.
- Renaming of joints and links for seamless integration with ros2_control 
  and soarm101_hardware packages.

This product includes software and designs developed by The Robot Studio.